    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The first full chapter of CatSacks is here!  </h2><br>You will receive <strong><i>all</i></strong> four full chapters of hidden object and find-the-differences puzzles for this one price through this year - no extra DLC costs!<br><br>Thank you so much for supporting this old lady's FIRST real game; it will fund future fun and all the wonderful people who helped make this a reality!<br><br>Check out the new video trailer by GeekEKitten to celebrate the game\u2019s official release &amp; ask all of your pawsome Padawan pals to wishlist \ud83d\ude3b<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Many thanks in advance for wishlisting...</h2> ...and please don't hesitate to reach out with feedback - your input is valuable! I appreciate you taking the time to 'paws' here for a quick miao!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352480/extras/52573a9cca5feab03077eb7c01a80ac1.avif?t=1717602627\" /></span><br><br>It's the annual Catawauloo scout camping trip at Farmer Calico's farm! The cat scouts are excited to earn new badges and play their favorite games - especially the big sack race!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Click, slide, &amp; spin objects to find hidden cats and other floofy animals in four catastical worlds.</h2>  Locate all the cats to give them their race sacks before a big autumn storm rolls in...and some unexpected guests drop by.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352480/extras/5f4c493014e9bc91ca538de9b9a44d6a.poster.avif?t=1717602627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352480/extras/5f4c493014e9bc91ca538de9b9a44d6a.webm?t=1717602627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352480/extras/5f4c493014e9bc91ca538de9b9a44d6a.mp4?t=1717602627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > I can't believe this is real!</h2><br>I am so excited - let\u2019s be honest, a little terrified!  Building a game is no joke and I'm so lucky to have found amazing people to help me learn what I needed along the way.<br><br>This first game is a kitty-themed homage to the Where's Waldo (Wally) books, &quot;Find the Differences&quot; challenges in kid's magazines at the dentist in the 80's, <br>point &amp; click adventures of the 90's, and flash games of the early 2000's, all of which shaped me as a gamer.<br><br>And what better way could there be to learn C# and Unity than to make a silly game about all the adorable floofs I know and love?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What will the future include?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> \ud83d\ude3b Colorful worlds with multiple levels to search &amp; explore<br></li><li> \ud83d\ude3b A menagerie of fuzzy friends &amp; out of this world visitors<br></li><li> \ud83d\ude3b Real life kitty voice actors, original music &amp; twists on old favorites<br></li><li> \ud83d\ude3b Secrets to find &amp; puzzles to uncover<br></li><li> \ud83d\ude3b Easter eggs, easter eggs, and more easter eggs </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352480/extras/b4d01e8968fbb7b4196b6509d14989d0.poster.avif?t=1717602627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352480/extras/b4d01e8968fbb7b4196b6509d14989d0.webm?t=1717602627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352480/extras/b4d01e8968fbb7b4196b6509d14989d0.mp4?t=1717602627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352480/extras/30977a54bb9e257e8ab3b095f8779692.poster.avif?t=1717602627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352480/extras/30977a54bb9e257e8ab3b095f8779692.webm?t=1717602627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352480/extras/30977a54bb9e257e8ab3b095f8779692.mp4?t=1717602627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
